### 三、Tiling 函数怎么写（host 侧，`op_host/算子名称.cpp`）

```cpp
namespace optiling {
const uint32_t BLOCK_DIM = 8;
const uint32_t TILE_NUM = 8;
static ge::graphStatus TilingFunc(gert::TilingContext* context)
{
    TilingData tiling;
    // 1. 从上下文获取动态输入shape
    uint32_t totalLength = context->GetInputTensor(0)->GetShapeSize();
    // 属性/各维长度也可取：context->GetInputShape(0)->GetStorageShape().GetDim(i)
    //                     context->GetAttrs()->GetAttrPointer<uint32_t>(0)
    // 2. 设置block_dim
    context->SetBlockDim(BLOCK_DIM);
    // 3. 填TilingData并序列化进上下文
    tiling.set_totalLength(totalLength);
    tiling.set_tileNum(TILE_NUM);
    tiling.SaveToBuffer(context->GetRawTilingData()->GetData(),
                        context->GetRawTilingData()->GetCapacity());
    context->GetRawTilingData()->SetDataSize(tiling.GetDataSize());
    // 4. 可选：TilingKey 选择 kernel 分支
    context->SetTilingKey(1);
    // 5. 可选：workspace
    size_t *currentWorkspace = context->GetWorkspaceSizes(1);
    currentWorkspace[0] = 0;
    return ge::GRAPH_SUCCESS;
}
} // namespace optiling
```

非对齐 shape 的约束（官方给出）：
- UB 数据需 32 字节对齐：`ALIGN_NUM = BLOCK_SIZE / sizeof(dtype)`（half 时为 16），`totalLengthAligned = ((totalLength + ALIGN_NUM - 1) / ALIGN_NUM) * ALIGN_NUM`。
